# 论文图件工作区 git 规则：
# - 提交 README、experiment_info、日志、绘图脚本和测试脚本。
# - 不提交候选图、最终图、按版本生成的候选结果元数据。
experiments/*/candidates/**/*.png
experiments/*/candidates/**/*.pdf
experiments/*/candidates/**/manifest_v*.json
experiments/*/candidates/**/selection_summary_v*.md
experiments/*/shortlisted/**/*.png
experiments/*/shortlisted/**/*.pdf
experiments/*/shortlisted/**/manifest_v*.json
experiments/*/shortlisted/**/selection_summary_v*.md
experiments/*/final/**/*.png
experiments/*/final/**/*.pdf
experiments/*/final/**/manifest_v*.json
experiments/*/final/**/selection_summary_v*.md

# Python 缓存和临时文件
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.tmp
*.temp
